  "id": "mango-guacamole",
  "name": "Mango Guacamole",
  "subtitle": "Creamy avocado dip with bright mango and lime",
  "description": "A fresh, sweet-savory guacamole combining mashed avocado with mango, onion, lime, garlic, cilantro, and salt.",
